    "title": "Impacting newborn care through simulation-based education",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "CIME in collaboration with the Department of Paediatrics and Child Health organised NRP to improve the competence and performance of NICU staff.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "39b6715a28b05b5b",
